{"id": "ef0ed693-d901-48dc-8243-2c3fc6c35224", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T23:03:30.527758", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "5995ae87-5543-4234-ab35-0752b0c60635", "thought": [], "reasoning_content": "Workspace only has task.json. No dependencies. Confirm no GPU check needed (env says gpu_enabled false). Now produce the plan handoff in Russian.", "thinking_blocks": [], "responses_reasoning_item": null, "action": {"stage": "plan", "answer": "## 1. Инспекция входных данных

